# Image processing toolbox — raw development (incl. Nikon NEF) + raster tools.
#
# Raw / NEF developers:
darktable                # raw developer; `darktable-cli` exports NEF headlessly (GUI: `darktable`)
rawtherapee               # alternative raw developer; `rawtherapee-cli` headless export
libraw-bin                # LibRaw CLI: `raw-identify`, `dcraw_emu`, `unprocessed_raw`
dcraw                     # classic `dcraw` raw decoder (NEF-aware) + Fuji helpers
#
# Raster manipulation & metadata:
imagemagick               # `convert`, `identify`, `mogrify`, `montage`, ...
libimage-exiftool-perl    # `exiftool` — read/write EXIF/IPTC/XMP metadata
exiftran                  # lossless JPEG rotation/crop
#
# Lossless optimizers:
jpegoptim
optipng
pngcrush
